    "Source organization labels cannot propose LegalEntity identities; endpoint refuses before source access. Existing records are not rewritten.",
    "Shared company-directory/1 admits explicit approved declarations or exact configured workspaces; observations and filing parties remain review-only. Full-width searchable directory replaces floating chooser.",
    "Root company, Finance, Regulation and map guards preserve exact scope. Unresolved company never becomes global scope; global geography/legal library requires explicit choice.",
    "Canonical financial discovery and exact retained posted/accepted movement results use the shared worksheet. Historical reopening remains independent of current discovery availability.",
    "Accepted worksheet displays retained account values and original source/journal evidence without recalculation or company-total double counting. Typed reference details require Advanced; scalar business facts stay visible.",
    "Read-only transformation plan preview binds Start inspected plan to the reviewed request/hash before retention and execution; metadata preview is not transformed-row output."
  ],
